HO) with Solidity smart contract interfaces.\\n\\n\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"\\n\\n## ECHO合约接口文档\\n\\nFound and extracted the ECHO docx file. It contains technical documentation for the **DimAI ECHO** blockchain protocol with Solidity contract interfaces. Here's the structure:\\n\\n### 1. ECHO 接口\\n- **1.1** 资产创建和租用 - `mint()`, `createDerivative()`, `rentEcho()`, `authorizedAsUser()`, `selfDerive()`\\n- **1.2** 费用、状态设置更新 - `updateRentalInfo()`, `setExtensible()`, `setDerivTerms()`, `setProtectedSourceURI()`, `setBlueprintURI()`\\n- **1.3** 使用权管理 - Interface `IECHO`: `updateRentalInfo()`, `pauseRental()`, `userOf()`, `useECHO()`, `getRentableStatus()`, `getRentalInfo()`, `getRemainingTimes()`, etc.\\n- **1.4** 可租赁+分润模块 - `IECHORentable`: `settleRemainingRental()`, events for `EchoRented`, `RevenueDistributedBase`\\n- **1.5** 拓展权授权 - `IECHOPermissioned`: `useECHOOf()`, `setExtensible()`, `approvePermission()`, `revokePermission()`, `isPermissioned()`\\n- **1.6** 拓展权申请 - `IECHOPermissionRequestable`: `requestPermission()`, `approvePermissionRequest()`, `rejectPermissionRequest()`, `getPermissionRequest()`, `updateSceneBeneficiary()`\\n- **1.7** 拓展使用和分润 - Revenue distribution for scenes with `RevenueDistributedForScene` event\\n- **1.8** 衍生权管理 - `IECHODerivable`: derivative graph management, `requestAsDerivative()`, `approveDerivativeRequest()`, `rejectDerivativeRequest()`, parent/child relationships\\n- **1.9** 衍生分润 - `DerivFeePaid`, `DerivRevenueDistributed` events\\n\\nThis is a comprehensive NFT rental/licensing protocol allowing:\\n- Original & derivative token minting\\n- Time-based or usage-based rental\\n- Revenue sharing (usage royalties, scene shares, parent shares)\\n- Extension permissions for third-party contracts\\n- Derivative relationships with approval workflows\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n          \"provider\": \"scnet\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.5\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 0,\n            \"output\": 0,\n            \"totalTokens\": 0,\n            \"cacheRead\": 0,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774788463346,\n          \"responseId\": \"chatcmpl-3f41aecd4355a180c603b699553f1053\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"cca63bc5\",\n            \"seq\": 10\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:lucus:subagent:ad31d9a6-a65f-4a5c-9805-f46a27991a3c\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:g-agent-lucus-subagent-ad31d9a6-a65f-4a5c-9805-f46a27991a3c\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774787883199,\n      \"sessionId\": \"d3ef7256-41bf-47b4-ba61-46e1364990fa\",\n      \"model\": \"minimax-m2.5:free\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 11300,\n      \"estimatedCostUsd\": 0,\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1774787839879,\n      \"endedAt\": 1774787881620,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 39359,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/lucus/sessions/d3ef7256-41bf-47b4-ba61-46e1364990fa.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"Got the content. Let me present this more cleanly.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"Found the ECHO docx file and extracted its content. Here's what it contains:\\n\\n---\\n\\n**ECHO合约接口1**\\n\\n### 接口1.1 资产创建和租用 (Solidity)\\n\\n- **mint(string memory _uri)** — 创建一个原创ECHO token\\n- **createDerivative(string memory _uri, EchoAsset[] memory parents)** — 创建一个衍生品\\n- **rentEcho(uint256 tokenId, uint256 _useTimes)** — 租赁使用权接口（购买使用次数/时长）\\n- **authorizedAsUser(address _user, uint256 tokenId, uint256 _useTimes)** — 主动授权一个用户为使用者（赠送使用次数）\\n- **selfDerive(string[] memory parentsUris, string memory childUri)** — 自衍生接口：用自己的资产衍生一个新资产，省略自付费和自授权过程\\n\\n### 接口1.2 费用、状态设置更新 (TypeScript)\\n\\n- **updateRentalInfo(uint256 tokenId, uint256 _feesInWei, uint256 _durationInSeconds, address _paymentToken)** — 设置单位租赁周期的费用和租赁类型\\n- **setExtensible(uint256 tokenId, bool extensible, uint256 allowedShare)** — 拓展权限开关设置、以及允许最大分润比例设置\\n- **DerivativeTerms struct** — 衍生条款，记录衍生收费信息（upfrontFee一次性衍生费、paymentToken支付代币地址、usageRoyalty使用版税）\\n\\n> ⚠️ 注意：只有拓展场景的合约没有衍生品创建接口，只有 mint 接口\\n\\n---\\n\\n文件路径：`/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/ECHOå_çº_æ_å---0158f53a-93a3-44f8-8420-ee83b220528f.docx`\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax\",\n          \"model\": \"minimax-m2.5:free\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 2526,\n            \"output\": 382,\n            \"totalTokens\": 11682,\n            \"cacheRead\": 8774,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774787867972,\n          \"responseId\": \"0618501c501a0254f5b85d10e809b645\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"ade556a5\",\n            \"seq\": 12\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:lucus:subagent:3a0976da-6220-4116-9d7e-8aab7a2df856\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:g-agent-lucus-subagent-3a0976da-6220-4116-9d7e-8aab7a2df856\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774786670257,\n      \"sessionId\": \"6636b052-f802-48d7-9edb-77548b048916\",\n      \"model\": \"minimax-m2.5