tChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a","lastAccountId":"lucus","transcriptPath":"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/lucus/sessions/f0a57948-c6f9-4884-a906-2c0364727329.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to clear/clean up historical sessions. Let me check what sessions exist first."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ap5ci062zgt2_1","name":"sessions_list","arguments":{"limit":20,"messageLimit":1}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":38,"output":59,"totalTokens":12822,"cacheRead":12247,"cacheWrite":478,"cost":{"total":0.0009962699999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774788837857,"responseId":"061853e6a91efcf54d630aee49da8e2c","__openclaw":{"id":"0bd54032","seq":13}}]},{"key":"agent:lucus:subagent:ed8de6b2-57d4-48d2-aefb-109305e3f820","kind":"other","channel":"feishu","displayName":"feishu:g-agent-lucus-subagent-ed8de6b2-57d4-48d2-aefb-109305e3f820","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu"},"updatedAt":1774788536009,"sessionId":"3c0ce9b2-65d8-4954-825f-1dffba04a28a","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","contextTokens":128000,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774788433777,"endedAt":1774788535676,"runtimeMs":99665,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","transcriptPath":"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/lucus/sessions/3c0ce9b2-65d8-4954-825f-1dffba04a28a.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The file has been extracted and the content is quite extensive - it's documentation for the ECHO合约接口 (ECHO Contract Interface). Let me format this nicely for the user.\n\nThe document contains:\n1. ECHO 接口 (ECHO Interface)\n   - 1.1 资产创建和租用 (Asset Creation and Rental)\n   - 1.2 费用、状态设置更新 (Fee and Status Settings)\n   - 1.3 使用权管理 (Usage Rights Management)\n   - 1.4 可租赁+分润模块 (Rentable + Revenue Split Module)\n   - 1.5 拓展权授权 (Extension Authorization)\n   - 1.6 拓展权申请 (Extension Request Application)\n   - 1.7 拓展使用和分润 (Extension Usage and Revenue Split)\n   - 1.8 衍生权管理 (Derivative Rights Management)\n   - 1.9 衍生分润 (Derivative Revenue Distribution)\n\nThis is technical documentation for a blockchain NFT protocol (DimAI ECHO) with Solidity smart contract interfaces.\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO合约接口文档\n\nFound and extracted the ECHO docx file. It contains technical documentation for the **DimAI ECHO** blockchain protocol with Solidity contract interfaces. Here's the structure:\n\n### 1. ECHO 接口\n- **1.1** 资产创建和租用 - `mint()`, `createDerivative()`, `rentEcho()`, `authorizedAsUser()`, `selfDerive()`\n- **1.2** 费用、状态设置更新 - `updateRentalInfo()`, `setExtensible()`, `setDerivTerms()`, `setProtectedSourceURI()`, `setBlueprintURI()`\n- **1.3** 使用权管理 - Interface `IECHO`: `updateRentalInfo()`, `pauseRental()`, `userOf()`, `useECHO()`, `getRentableStatus()`, `getRentalInfo()`, `getRemainingTimes()`, etc.\n- **1.4** 可租赁+分润模块 - `IECHORentable`: `settleRemainingRental()`, events for `EchoRented`, `RevenueDistributedBase`\n- **1.5** 拓展权授权 - `IECHOPermissioned`: `useECHOOf()`, `setExtensible()`, `approvePermission()`, `revokePermission()`, `isPermissioned()`\n- **1.6** 拓展权申请 - `IECHOPermissionRequestable`: `requestPermission()`, `approvePermissionRequest()`, `rejectPermissionRequest()`, `getPermissionRequest()`, `updateSceneBeneficiary()`\n- **1.7** 拓展使用和分润 - Revenue distribution for scenes with `RevenueDistributedForScene` event\n- **1.8** 衍生权管理 - `IECHODerivable`: derivative graph management, `requestAsDerivative()`, `approveDerivativeRequest()`, `rejectDerivativeRequest()`, parent/child relationships\n- **1.9** 衍生分润 - `DerivFeePaid`, `DerivRevenueDistributed` events\n\nThis is a comprehensive NFT rental/licensing protocol allowing:\n- Original & derivative token minting\n- Time-based or usage-based rental\n- Revenue sharing (usage royalties, scene shares, parent shares)\n- Extension permissions for third-party contracts\n- Derivative relationships with approval workflows"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"totalTokens":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774788463346,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3f41aecd4355a180c603b699553f1053","__openclaw":{"id":"cca63bc5","seq":10}}]},{"key":"agent:lucus:subagent:ad31d9a6-a65f-4a5c-9805-f46a27991a3c","kind":"other","channel":"feishu","displayName":"feishu:g-agent-lucus-subagent-ad31d9a6-a65f-4a5c-9805-f46a27991a3c","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu"},"updatedAt":1774787883199,"sessionId":"d3ef7256-41bf-47b4-ba61-46e1364990fa","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":11300,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774787839879,"endedAt":1774787881620,"runtimeMs":39359,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","transcriptPath":"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/lucus/sessions/d3ef7256-41bf-47b4-ba61-46e1364990fa.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Got the content. Let me present this more cleanly."},{"type":"text","text":"Found the ECHO docx file and extracted its content. Here's what it contains:\n\n---\n\n**ECHO合约接口1**\n\n### 接口1.1 资产创建和租用 (Solidity)\n\n- **mint(string memory _uri)** — 创建一个原创ECHO token\n- **createDerivative(string memory _uri, EchoAsset[] memory parents)** — 创建一个衍生品\n- **rentEcho(uint256 tokenId, uint256 _useTimes)** — 租赁使用权接口（购买使用次数/时长）\n- **authorizedAsUser(address _user, uint256 tokenId, uint256 _useTimes)** — 主动授权一个用户为使用者（赠送使用次数）\n- **selfDerive(string[] memory parentsUris, string memory childUri)** — 自衍生接口：用自己的资产衍生一个新资产，省略自付费和自授权过程\n\n### 接口1.2 费用、状态设置更新 (TypeScript)\n\n- **updateRentalInfo(uint256 tokenId, uint256 _feesInWei, uint256 _durationInSeconds, address _paymentToken)** — 设置单位租赁周期的费用和租赁类型\n- **setExtensible(uint256 tokenId, bool extensible, uint256 allowedShare)** — 拓展权限开关设置、以及允许最大分润比例设置\n- **DerivativeTerms struct** — 衍生条款，记录衍生收费信息（upfrontFee一次性衍生费、paymentToken支付代币地址、usageRoyalty使用版税）\n\n> ⚠️ 注意：只有拓展场景的合约没有衍生品创建接口，只有 mint 接口\n\n---\n\n文件路径：`/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/ECHOå_çº_æ_å---0158f53a-93a3-44f8-8420-ee83b220528f.docx`"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":2526,"output":382,"totalTokens":11682,"cacheRead":8774,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774787867972,"responseId":"0618501c501a0254f5b85d10e809b645","__openclaw":{"id":"ade556a5","seq":12}}]},{"key":"agent:lucus:subagent:3a0976da-6220-4116-9d7e-8aab7a2df856","kind":"other","channel":"feishu","displayName":"feishu:g-agent-lucus-subagent-3a0976da-6220-4116-9d7e-8aab7a2df856","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu"},"updatedAt":1774786670257,"sessionId":"6636b052-f802-48d7-9edb-77548b048916","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":6836,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774786660709,"endedAt":1774786669721,"runtimeMs":6682,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","transcriptPath":"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/lucus/sessions/6636b052-f802-48d7-9edb-77548b048916.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The subagent was asked to find and read an ECHO docx file from the inbound media directory. Let me run the command again to find and read the content."},{"type":"text","text":"\n<minimax:tool_call>\n<invoke name=\"exec\">\n<parameter name=\"command\">python3 << 'EOF'\nfrom docx import Document\nimport os\n\n# Find the docx file\nfor f in os.listdir('/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/'):\n    if 'ECHO' in f and f.endswith('.docx'):\n        print(f\"Found: {f}\")\n        doc = Document(os.path.join('/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/', f))\n        text = '\\n'.join([p.text for p in doc.paragraphs if p.text.strip()])\n        print(text[:8000])\n        break\nelse:\n    print(\"No ECHO docx file found\")\nEOF</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</minimax:tool_call>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider