{"type":"message","id":"65785fdc","parentId":"5502d569","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:04:06.279Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The app (cli_a93108fad2b81e15) doesn't have the `docx:document:create` scope. It only has certain scopes enabled. The feishu_doc tool works because it's registered with the gateway and uses a bot that has the right scopes.\n\nThe issue is:\n1. The feishu_doc tool isn't available as a direct tool to me (it's registered with the agent runtime but not exposed as one of my direct tools)\n2. The REST API approach fails because the app doesn't have document creation scope\n\nThe correct solution would be to use the feishu_doc tool which is available to the main agent when it processes requests. But I'm having trouble invoking it directly.\n\n\nI should explain to the user that document creation isn't possible right now due to missing API permissions—the app needs the `docx:document:create` scope enabled in its Feishu configuration.","thinkingSignature":"a1787a7a88db0ad52d85d0b958fcf21c2fd9364790fd9c05f7b9ecfcb24da541"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 抱歉，我自己直接调也遇到了问题。\n\n原因找到了：**Feishu 应用（lucus 账号）没有开通 `docx:document:create` 权限**，所以：\n- REST API 直接调 → 权限不足\n- `openclaw feishu doc` CLI → 这个工具在 gateway 那边注册了，但我这边 exec 调也hang住（可能是 gateway 通信问题）\n\n**解决方案**：需要在飞书开放平台给这个应用开通「文档写入」权限：\n1. 去 https://open.feishu.cn/app/cli_a93108fad2b81e15\n2. 权限管理 → 开通 `docx:document` 和 `docx:document:create`\n3. 重新发布\n\n开通后我就能直接创建文档了。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":51147,"output":350,"cacheRead":11030,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":62527,"cost":{"input":0.0153441,"output":0.00041999999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0006617999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0164259}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774789433395,"responseId":"06185639da2abc2e5b12e0db555c5b73"}}
{"type":"message","id":"4133a207","parentId":"65785fdc","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:04:09.185Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-29 13:02:46 UTC] Exec failed (rapid-cl, signal SIGTERM) :: [35m[plugins][39m [36mfeishu_doc: Registered feishu_doc, feishu_app_scopes[39m [35m[plugins][39m [36mfeishu_chat: Registered feishu_chat tool[39m [35m[plugins][39m [36mfeishu_wiki…\nSystem: [2026-03-29 13:03:03 UTC] Exec failed (gentle-c, signal SIGTERM)\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a67ae538a0ee7f0827ab70a95\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 13:04 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53a67ae538a0ee7f0827ab70a95]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 为什么subagent总失败，然后你还要一直去掉用subagent，如果需要subagent，那他有问题，你是不是该给出解决修复方案"}],"timestamp":1774789449159}}
{"type":"message","id":"1eb030b2","parentId":"4133a207","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:04:26.505Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is frustrated that subagents keep failing and that I keep calling them. They're right - I should be more proactive about fixing issues rather than just spawning subagents that fail.\n\nLet me think about what's actually happening:\n1. The subagents ARE completing (from the session list, they all show \"done\" status)\n2. The issue is that the subagent tasks are failing because the feishu_doc tool isn't properly configured\n3. When I try to run openclaw CLI commands directly via exec, they hang (SIGTERM)\n\nThe core problem is that:\n1. `openclaw feishu doc create` CLI hangs when called via exec\n2. The feishu app doesn't have the `docx:document:create` permission\n\nThe user is asking: if subagent is the primary mechanism and it's failing, shouldn't I fix the subagent system rather than keep calling it?\n\nThey're absolutely right. I should:\n1. Diagnose WHY exec commands to openclaw hang\n2. Fix the underlying issue\n3. Or provide a proper solution\n\nLet me not spawn another subagent and instead actually diagnose the issue. The exec hangs when trying to run `openclaw feishu` commands - this might be because the gateway is blocking or because the feishu extension's CLI is trying to connect to the gateway and causing a deadlock.\n\nLet me check if there's a gateway running and if the feishu plugin CLI is independent.","thinkingSignature":"a4fdd2ca45cd733a6e419c21d7ea4a00f7cca690cfe11fa00acdd78caf847f16"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 你说得对，我一直用 subagent 绕来绕去，但它失败了我没给出修复方案。让我先搞清楚为什么 exec 调 `openclaw feishu` 会 hang。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9scjjkhpo7uc_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ps aux | grep -i openclaw | grep -v grep | head -10","timeout":5}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":38,"output":388,"c