{"type":"message","id":"e3843fe4","parentId":"f4aba9a6","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:11:59.754Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The block_type 3 (heading1) seems to not be valid in the children API. Let me check what block types are available. Actually, looking at the original document I read, the heading blocks might need different type numbers. Let me try block_type 4 for heading 1, or 5 for heading 2, etc.\n\nActually, looking at the Feishu API docs, the block types are:\n- 1: page\n- 2: text\n- 3: image\n- 4: table\n- 5: todo\n- 6: bullet\n- 7: heading1\n- 8: heading2\n- 9: heading3\n- etc.\n\nWait, let me re-check. \n\nLooking at the official Feishu documentation, I'm seeing that heading1 is actually block_type 7, so I should try using that instead.","thinkingSignature":"f04ada98e32c65469db97dd63fad97b897ceef56db4a3e763f684a142bdbbb0c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rge8c8pehviu_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/KFZ5dQFLtoCey1xV5Nfjl0nTp8f/blocks/KFZ5dQFLtoCey1xV5Nfjl0nTp8f/children\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g2073td3EKILAO7NBFLGV5SNRALOBZCKUNI6VDP4\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"children\": [{\n      \"block_type\": 7,\n      \"heading1\": {\n        \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"一、资产创建和租用 (1.1)\"}}],\n        \"style\": {}\n      }\n    }],\n    \"index\": 100\n  }' 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":70186,"output":404,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82152,"cost":{"input":0.0210558,"output":0.00048479999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02223432}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774789908737,"responseId":"061858155863b2a0b908d4629ee80220"}}
