{"type":"message","id":"7a972989","parentId":"4007bd0c","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:12:10.494Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting the error. Let me try a different approach. Maybe the block_type values are different from what I think. Let me check the actual block types by looking at what was created when the original document was created (the Hello World text block had block_type 2 for text).\n\nActually, I think the issue might be with the API endpoint. Maybe I need to use a different endpoint for creating blocks with specific types.\n\nLet me try using block_type 2 (text) for everything and just use bold text to simulate headings.","thinkingSignature":"c1dfedb4bbe39fae477caa3d8710e99353593dd58da5a667a7d9822c0d03d77e"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_r7kwfv0n45w4_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/KFZ5dQFLtoCey1xV5Nfjl0nTp8f/blocks/KFZ5dQFLtoCey1xV5Nfjl0nTp8f/children\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g2073td3EKILAO7NBFLGV5SNRALOBZCKUNI6VDP4\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"children\": [{\n      \"block_type\": 2,\n      \"text\": {\n        \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"【ECHO合约接口】技术文档摘要\", \"text_element_style\": {\"bold\": true}}}],\n        \"style\": {}\n      }\n    }],\n    \"index\": 100\n  }' 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":70649,"output":336,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82547,"cost":{"input":0.0211947,"output":0.0004032,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.022291619999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774789920495,"responseId":"0618582028ef7c7b3aa0b7e78dcd3bf5"}}
