{"type":"message","id":"dd2f6a5c","parentId":"d12549f7","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:15:27.221Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All content has been added successfully. Let me verify by reading the document.","thinkingSignature":"ed368b08e41cacb11116fda49c879400fdc04c3eb736ee47d3593465bd44503d"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] ✅ 总结写入完成！\n\n**文档链接**：https://larkwpublic.feishu.cn/docx/KFZ5dQFLtoCey1xV5Nfjl0nTp8f\n\n**写入内容概览**：\n- **1.1** 资产创建和租用 — mint / createDerivative / rentEcho / authorizedAsUser / selfDerive\n- **1.2** 费用与状态设置 — updateRentalInfo / setExtensible / setDerivTerms\n- **1.3** 使用权管理 IECHO — TimesBased vs DurationBased / userOf / useECHO / getRemainingTimes / getUseStatus\n- **1.4** 可租赁+分润模块 — EchoRented / RevenueDistributedBase / settleRemainingRental\n- **1.5** 拓展权授权 IECHOPermissioned — OwnerDirect / RequestBased / approvePermission / revokePermission\n- **1.6** 拓展权申请 IECHOPermissionRequestable — requestPermission / approvePermissionRequest / updateSceneBeneficiary\n- **1.7** 拓展使用和分润 — useECHOOf / RevenueDistributedForScene\n- **1.8** 衍生权管理 IECHODerivable — 衍生图谱 / getParentShareList / getDerivAttrs\n- **1.9** 衍生分润 — DerivFeePaid / DerivRevenueDistributed\n- **核心概念速查** — TimesBased/DurationBased/upfrontFee/usageRoyalty/sceneShare/unlicensed derivative 等"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79578,"output":340,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91480,"cost":{"input":0.0238734,"output":0.000408,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.024975119999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774790117848,"responseId":"061858e6598f288db717b53587dd1357"}}
