{"type":"message","id":"356d5a0d","parentId":"06b93906","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:18:01.110Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_0mz93kmlxp5b_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"code\":99991672,\"msg\":\"Access denied. One of the following scopes is required: [drive:drive, docs:doc, sheets:spreadsheet, bitable:bitable, wiki:wiki, bitable:app, docs:permission.member:retrieve].应用尚未开通所需的应用身份权限：[drive:drive, docs:doc, sheets:spreadsheet, bitable:bitable, wiki:wiki, bitable:app, docs:permission.member:retrieve]，点击链接申请并开通任一权限即可：https://open.feishu.cn/app/cli_a93108fad2b81e15/auth?q=drive:drive,docs:doc,sheets:spreadsheet,bitable:bitable,wiki:wiki,bitable:app,docs:permission.member:retrieve&op_from=openapi&token_type=tenant\",\"error\":{\"log_id\":\"20260329211800CD0BFAFE1012B7A31B6C\",\"permission_violations\":[{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"drive:drive\"},{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"docs:doc\"},{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"sheets:spreadsheet\"},{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"bitable:bitable\"},{\"subject\":\"wiki:wiki\",\"type\":\"action_scope_required\"},{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"bitable:app\"},{\"subject\":\"docs:permission.member:retrieve\",\"type\":\"action_scope_required\"}],\"message\":\"Refer to the documentation to fix the error: https://open.feishu.cn/document/uAjLw4CM/ugTN1YjL4UTN24CO1UjN/trouble-shooting/how-to-fix-the-99991672-error\"}}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":572,"aggregated":"{\"code\":99991672,\"msg\":\"Access denied. One of the following scopes is required: [drive:drive, docs:doc, sheets:spreadsheet, bitable:bitable, wiki:wiki, bitable:app, docs:permission.member:retrieve].应用尚未开通所需的应用身份权限：[drive:drive, docs:doc, sheets:spreadsheet, bitable:bitable, wiki:wiki, bitable:app, docs:permission.member:retrieve]，点击链接申请并开通任一权限即可：https://open.feishu.cn/app/cli_a93108fad2b81e15/auth?q=drive:drive,docs:doc,sheets:spreadsheet,bitable:bitable,wiki:wiki,bitable:app,docs:permission.member:retrieve&op_from=openapi&token_type=tenant\",\"error\":{\"log_id\":\"20260329211800CD0BFAFE1012B7A31B6C\",\"permission_violations\":[{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"drive:drive\"},{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"docs:doc\"},{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"sheets:spreadsheet\"},{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"bitable:bitable\"},{\"subject\":\"wiki:wiki\",\"type\":\"action_scope_required\"},{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"bitable:app\"},{\"subject\":\"docs:permission.member:retrieve\",\"type\":\"action_scope_required\"}],\"message\":\"Refer to the documentation to fix the error: https://open.feishu.cn/document/uAjLw4CM/ugTN1YjL4UTN24CO1UjN/trouble-shooting/how-to-fix-the-99991672-error\"}}","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774790281106}}
{"type":"message","id":"0545e01c","parentId":"356d5a0d","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:18:13.112Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still permission issues. Let me try to add permission directly when creating the document, or try to use a different API endpoint. Actually, when I created the document, I passed `owner_open_id` which should give the user full access. But the issue might be that the document is in the bot's drive space, not the user's.\n\nLet me try to transfer the document or add permissions. Actually, let me try the `member add` API with the docs:permission member scope.\n\nWait, I need to ask the user to grant the `drive:drive` or `docs:permission.member:retrieve` permission first.\n\nActually, there's another approach - when creating the document, the `owner_open_id` should have given the user full access. But it seems like the document might be in a location the user can't access.\n\n\nLet me reconsider this - maybe I can create the document in the user's personal folder or shared space instead. But I don't have a folder token to work with, and I can't retrieve document members without the proper permissions. The real issue is that creating a document with `owner_open_id` grants the user access to the document itself, but doesn't necessarily place it in a location they can already see. The user probably needs to either request access to the bot's folder, or I need to create the document in a shared space first.\n\nI should ask the user to grant `drive:drive` permission so I can properly configure the sharing settings.","thinkingSignature":"f7c81645b86b253460528373a706cc6b06e21d0532f3f7aac1a0e93db4eed35c"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 抱歉，这是我的问题。创建时传了 `owner_open_id`，理论上应该有权限，但应用还缺 `drive:drive` 权限，所以无法操作文档权限（查询/添加成员）。\n\n需要你再帮开一个权限：\n1. 打开 https://open.feishu.cn/app/cli_a93108fad2b81e15\n2. 权限管理 → 开通 `drive:drive`\n3. 重新发布\n\n开通后我立刻把文档的管理权限和编辑权限都给你。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax",