{"type":"message","id":"79263c9d","parentId":"36569d7f","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:20:27.097Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Oh! The user wanted me to create a \"Hello World\" document in my workspace (local filesystem), NOT in Feishu! I completely misunderstood. They were just testing if I could create a simple document in my own workspace, not using Feishu at all.\n\nLet me create a simple Hello World text file in my workspace.","thinkingSignature":"51c8fa71d3782d2e0e8e8deeb469e300b4ae8ff55f05f58917e84581e19a7530"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 啊！完全理解错了 — 你说的是在我本地工作区创建文档，不是飞书。抱歉绕了一大圈！\n\n我现在就创建一个：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_r34gdwqkst5d_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"Hello, World!\n\nThis is a test document created in my local workspace.\n\nCreated: 2026-03-29\n","file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/hello_world.txt"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":175,"cacheRead":91523,"cacheWrite":666,"totalTokens":92407,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.00020999999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00549138,"cacheWrite":0.00024975,"total":0.0059640299999999995}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774790419356,"responseId":"06185a14c97a410b9f26c7e4f63c3af7"}}
