{"type":"message","id":"4d3d319d","parentId":"1551d8f7","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:35:10.521Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The document has been written. Now let me give a summary to the user.","thinkingSignature":"24773dfb2ae1fc38239a0db348676634851e6c834e77810e6a8f72dfbe63c8a9"},{"type":"text","text":"设计文档已写入本地：`/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/echoagent_design.md`\n\n---\n\n## 文档核心内容速览\n\n**名字：EchoAgent** — 呼应 ECHO 协议 + 能力响应双重含义\n\n**三句话总结**：\n1. 每个 OpenCl️aw Agent 实例 = 一个 ECHO NFT，能力变成可交易资产\n2. Bridge 层负责链上事件 ↔ 链下 Agent 执行的联动（权限同步 / 分润触发 / 执行记录）\n3. 分润全自动结算——用户付租金 → 智能合约拆分 → Owner / 场景方 / 父代版税同时到账\n\n**九大模块**：\n- 合约层（扩展 ECHO 的 `EchoAgentRegistry` + `EchoAgentRental` 等）\n- Bridge 层（EventWatcher / PermissionSyncer / ExecutionLogger）\n- 能力路由（意图识别 → 能力匹配 → 权限检查 → 计费预标记）\n- 三种计费模式（TimesBased / DurationBased / SceneBased）\n- 完整分润分配规则（含衍生版税链）\n- 角色权限矩阵\n- 全流程交互示例（注册 → 租用 → 执行 → 分润 → 衍生）\n- 三阶段实现路线图（MVP → 多Agent协作 → DAO治理）\n\n需要我继续深挖哪个模块，或者做成飞书文档分享出去？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":87607,"output":306,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99475,"cost":{"input":0.0262821,"output":0.0003672,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02734302}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774791298186,"responseId":"06185d82dd9f2949f788faa07510a24a"}}
