{"type":"message","id":"0cd60be8","parentId":"b81d1135","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:44:55.691Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying they don't have permission to move the document because of folder permissions. This is about the Feishu document we just created. The document was created at the root level of the Feishu drive, and the user might want to move it to a specific folder. But since I don't have drive management permissions (only docx permissions), I can't move it. Let me check if I can move it via the API.\n\nActually, looking at the error message \"向 Lucus 申请移动\" - the user seems to be saying THEY (the user) got this error when trying to move the document, and it says they need to ask \"Lucus\" (which seems to be referring to the bot/app account) for permission to move it.\n \nThe user is probably trying to organize the document into a folder within Feishu Drive, but they're getting blocked by permission settings that require approval from the bot account to move files.","thinkingSignature":"2ab16e976c6074fcc62c6b09e4c02436d4dbf6700f927d5eee960dc7603122b6"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 我来帮你移动到文件夹里。先看看你的文件夹结构：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kd14akrg8l0g_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files?page_size=20\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g2073td3EKILAO7NBFLGV5SNRALOBZCKUNI6VDP4\" 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":310,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":100153,"totalTokens":112068,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.000372,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0.037557375000000004,"total":0.038635995000000006}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774791878980,"responseId":"06185fc792f626d5537c3b96bf633fcb"}}
