{"type":"message","id":"fef8a8a1","parentId":"70976623","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:45:08.111Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the documents are in a folder with parent_token \"nodjpaHe7MntogaRuHkK6FaF8cd\". I need to move the EchoAgent doc to a different folder. Let me check what folders exist.\n\nActually, the user said they got an error about folder permissions and need to ask Lucus to move it. Let me try to move the document using the drive move API.\n\nThe move API is: `PATCH /open-apis/drive/v1/files/{file_token}/move`\n\nOr it might be: `POST /open-apis/drive/v1/files/{file_token}/move`\n\nLet me try to move the EchoAgent doc to a root-level folder or a specific location. Actually, I think the issue is that the user (lucus bot) created the document in a folder that the user doesn't have write access to, and when they try to move it, Feishu requires permission from the parent folder owner.\n\n\nI'll attempt the move operation using the file token and specify a new parent folder to relocate the document.","thinkingSignature":"70c2e7856ab81ac33fb8b968e3c1e5f62249a6bb862c9054f2176d279c5c03d7"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mc55m9kxjx8d_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/C3FQdU5TEogY5LxpZCHj6x3BpVc/move\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g2073td3EKILAO7NBFLGV5SNRALOBZCKUNI6VDP4\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -X PATCH \\\n  -d '{\"type\":\"docx\",\"parent_token\":\"\"}' 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":100813,"output":365,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":112740,"cost":{"input":0.030243899999999997,"output":0.00043799999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03137562}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774791897064,"responseId":"06185fd9f6c2e77547a4c437ffd112ca"}}
