{"type":"message","id":"3b28fb1f","parentId":"a3a2eb42","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:45:15.218Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The move endpoint isn't quite right. Let me check the Feishu drive API documentation for the correct move endpoint.Actually, the correct API for moving a file in Feishu is:`PATCH /open-apis/drive/v1/files/{file_token}``with body: {\"parent_token\": \"new_parent_token\"}`\n\nBut if the file is already in a folder and we want to move it to root, the parent_token would be empty or \"\".Let me try again with the correct endpoint.","thinkingSignature":"df9d9b68c1740c9f38f5dc2e6672863039594bd6d911e89ad6721c02d50d6827"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_hbwwi2idxvty_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/C3FQdU5TEogY5LxpZCHj6x3BpVc\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g2073td3EKILAO7NBFLGV5SNRALOBZCKUNI6VDP4\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -X PATCH \\\n  -d '{\"parent_token\": \"\"}' 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":101198,"output":244,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":113004,"cost":{"input":0.030359399999999998,"output":0.00029279999999999996,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03134592}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774791908399,"responseId":"06185fe4d14fe1910036025e0c390bd7"}}
