{"type":"message","id":"415fc99e","parentId":"53946620","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:47:30.562Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to move the document to their personal document library (我的文档库). In Feishu, \"我的文档库\" is the root personal drive. The parent_token for the root is typically empty or a specific root folder token.\n\nLet me check the Feishu API for moving files. The correct API endpoint should be `PATCH /open-apis/drive/v1/files/{file_token}/move` with the type and new parent_token.\n\nFor the root personal drive, the parent_token might be empty string or a specific value. Let me try with empty string first.","thinkingSignature":"377b2f31b89d247ef9c0135cafba187fcbea0d189f9f0fd58d6a7f341b04c615"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8adn545k6a6a_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/C3FQdU5TEogY5LxpZCHj6x3BpVc/move?type=docx\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g2073td3EKILAO7NBFLGV5SNRALOBZCKUNI6VDP4\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -X PATCH \\\n  -d '{\"type\":\"docx\",\"parent_token\":\"\"}' 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":272,"cacheRead":111550,"cacheWrite":1396,"totalTokens":113261,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.00032639999999999996,"cacheRead":0.006692999999999999,"cacheWrite":0.0005235,"total":0.007555799999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774792036017,"responseId":"06186064f2a7bcd15630cdab368c8932"}}
