{"type":"message","id":"c74993b8","parentId":"e8e0389f","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:47:57.398Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me try a different approach - use the Feishu bot to move the file. Actually, looking at the error message more carefully: \"由于文件夹的权限设置，你没有当前文档的移动权限，请向 Lucus 申请移动。\" - This might be a UI error shown to the user when they try to move within the Feishu app, not an API error. The user is seeing this error in their Feishu client.\n\nThe real issue is that the document is currently in a folder, and to move it to the user's personal root documents, I need to use the correct API endpoint. In Feishu, moving a file to the root personal drive (\"我的文档库\") means setting parent_token to the root folder token.\n\n\nI need to retrieve the user's root folder token first, since different users have different root tokens in Feishu's structure, and moving to \"我的文档库\" requires knowing the correct target folder.","thinkingSignature":"923a3a870e7799724f635cab81f29d0b57827d68268363fccf2fb9a74bf0ac23"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_v375k1bnq7tc_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/users/me/drive_info\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g2073td3EKILAO7NBFLGV5SNRALOBZCKUNI6VDP4\" 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":102342,"output":289,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":114193,"cost":{"input":0.0307026,"output":0.00034679999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03174312}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774792068157,"responseId":"061860841dab630eaf09754ab3c1fa64"}}
