{"type":"message","id":"541532a6","parentId":"e77872a2","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:48:04.087Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me try another approach. The file move API in Feishu is:\n`POST /open-apis/drive/v1/files/{file_token}/move`\n\nAnd the body should include the `type` and `parent_token`. The `parent_token` for the user's personal root might be obtained from their user info.\n\nActually, let me try to get the user's drive info using the user ID.","thinkingSignature":"b858a541e168a82bc0dc742290a92e9d8f0cbbe6c118d6fa50a6b0b6e2a3e62b"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_iuzs4wsc0agg_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/users/ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a/drive_info\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g2073td3EKILAO7NBFLGV5SNRALOBZCKUNI6VDP4\" 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":102651,"output":198,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":114411,"cost":{"input":0.030795299999999998,"output":0.0002376,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03172662}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774792077641,"responseId":"0618608ec429532fdc8581d04b48b886"}}
