{"type":"message","id":"28bbae65","parentId":"0e38ea67","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:48:17.539Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_i90naqagxv4v_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"code\":1061002,\"msg\":\"params error.\",\"error\":{\"log_id\":\"20260329214817A370BBA233FF42B32C69\"}}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":635,"aggregated":"{\"code\":1061002,\"msg\":\"params error.\",\"error\":{\"log_id\":\"20260329214817A370BBA233FF42B32C69\"}}","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774792097532}}
{"type":"message","id":"a67f21e8","parentId":"28bbae65","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:48:30.642Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting a params error. Let me look at the Feishu API docs more carefully. The issue might be that the `file_token` in the URL should be just the file token without the prefix. Actually `C3FQdU5TEogY5LxpZCHj6x3BpVc` is the correct format.\n\nLet me try with a different Content-Type or check if the file needs to be shared first before it can be moved. Actually, let me think about this differently.\n\nThe error the user is seeing (\"由于文件夹的权限设置，你没有当前文档的移动权限，请向 Lucus 申请移动\") is a Feishu UI error, not an API error. \n\nSo the user is getting this in the Feishu app itself, not through the API. The real problem is that the document was created by the bot and placed in the bot's folder, so the user doesn't have move permissions even though they have edit access. I should try moving it to a shared folder instead, or check what shared folders are available that the user can access.\n\nActually, I realize I already gave the user full_access permission on the document, which should include move rights according to Feishu's permission model. The issue might be on the API side - let me try a different method to move the file, perhaps using a patch request to the file endpoint directly.","thinkingSignature":"4f8bd110a4c6d43b1e02772e297eab6678b7187f4a0ab11faa50ed28914edcde"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_r1ln0xjbt6dk_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/C3FQdU5TEogY5LxpZCHj6x3BpVc\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g2073td3EKILAO7NBFLGV5SNRALOBZCKUNI6VDP4\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -X GET 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":103320,"output":413,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":115295,"cost":{"input":0.030996,"output"