{"type":"message","id":"6b94f982","parentId":"240236be","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:53:43.030Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The permission shows full_access for the user's open_id. But the user says they don't have it. Maybe the permission was added to the document but the user is not seeing it due to the document being in the bot's folder. Let me try to share the document to the user's personal space by changing the folder.\n\nActually, the issue is likely that the document is in the bot's folder (nodjpaHe7MntogaRuHkK6FaF8cd), not in the user's personal drive. Even though the user has full_access permission on the document, they might not be able to move it because the folder permissions are controlled by the bot.\n\nLet me just tell the user to manually move it, or try to move it to the root of the user's drive. Actually, let me try to re-invite them with full_access permission again, and also try the move API.\n\n\nThe permissions are definitely set correctly in the system, so the user either isn't seeing the update or there's a delay in how it's displayed. Since I can't resolve this without knowing their user token, I should just suggest they manually move the document from the bot's folder to their personal space.","thinkingSignature":"6a3b9dda262680e216a522bae913c563d0fbf7a9c0c188d855e910815c66e9f8"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 后台显示你的权限是 `full_access`，但文档在 bot 的文件夹里（不是你的个人文档库），所以即使有权限你也看不到移动到个人库的选项。\n\n**最简单的方法**：你在飞书 app 里打开这个文档 → 右上角「···」→「移动」→ 选「我的文档库」。你有 full_access，理论上这个操作应该可以。\n\n如果移动按钮是灰色的，告诉我，我再想想别的办法。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":103467,"output":335,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":115364,"cost":{"input":0.031040099999999998,"output":0.00040199999999999996,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03213582}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774792410943,"responseId":"061861db91db8b4b4af6aed47bec434b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3df70fd9","parentId":"6b94f982","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:57:04.422Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a6b42e24a0ee8e5d1c22532f3\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 13:57 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53a6b42e24a0ee8e5d1c22532f3]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 申请移动文档\n由于文件夹的权限设置，你没有当前文档的移动权限，请向 Lucus 申请移动。\n这就是我执行的结果"}],"timestamp":1774792624416}}
{"type":"message","id":"0417e996","parentId":"3df70fd9","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:57:19.494Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is getting an error message from Feishu itself saying they can't move the document because of folder permissions. The document is in a folder that the bot created, and even though they have full_access on the document itself, they can't move it because the folder permissions don't allow it.\n\nThe solution is to either:\n1. Copy the content to a new document in their personal space\n2. Have the bot move the document to the user's space (but bot's personal space might not exist)\n3. Create the document directly in the user's space using the user's token\n\nActually, the real issue is that the document lives in the bot's folder, and the user doesn't have access to that folder. The user has access to the document itself, but moving a document requires having write access to both the source folder AND the destination folder.\n\n\nThe most straightforward approach would be to create a fresh document in the user's personal space and transfer the content over, rather than trying to move the existing one.","thinkingSignature":"0c6dd6dfdf50dd65ba0066e4dcdb6535529d4683a3416e780c854cfd07de1d73"},{"type":"text","text":"\n[[reply_to_current]] 明白了——文档在 bot 的文件夹里，你的账号能访问文档本身，但没权限操作那个文件夹的移动功能。\n\n**解法**：我直接在「你的文档库」里重新创建一份内容一样的文档，这样就直接在你的空间里了。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_klajo8j9i8k7_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"app_id\":\"cli_a93108fad2b81e15\",\"app_secret\":\"YXsvQgicI06FJkWenoDpggitFT6TCgVq\"}' 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":373,"cacheRead":114722,"cacheWrite":627,"totalTokens":115765,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.0004476,"cacheRead":0.006883319999999999,"cacheWrite":0.000235125,"total":0.007578944999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774792624422,"responseId":"061862b18b39865b996ae52f01c0fbda"}}
