{"type":"message","id":"26e81e9b","parentId":"6e375dcb","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:57:28.443Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me create a new document in the user's personal space. But I don't know their personal space root folder token. Let me try to create the document without specifying a folder token - maybe it defaults to the bot's root, not the user's. Actually, the issue is that documents created via API go to the bot's space.\n\nLet me think... I could try using the user's OAuth token instead of the tenant token. But the user said I should get their user token myself. \n\nActually, wait - the simplest solution might be to try creating the document with the user's open_id as owner. The document creation API might create it in the owner's personal space rather than the bot's space. Let me try that.","thinkingSignature":"25afec9a73fa0859b3a10b3c4a28c6f14da6e5775ee3e9c8ff9e5e0873d2243c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ddkviloujbe5_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g2073td3EKILAO7NBFLGV5SNRALOBZCKUNI6VDP4\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"title\": \"EchoAgent 设计文档 - 基于 ECHO 协议的 AI Agent 执行中枢\", \"owner_open_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"}' 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":104263,"output":303,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":116128,"cost":{"input":0.0312789,"output":0.0003636,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03233622}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774792639840,"responseId":"061862c0cf4de43c840c674b6bee8131"}}
