{"type":"message","id":"263d70aa","parentId":"b7b396de","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:58:02.543Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The new document has no members listed, which means the owner might not be explicitly listed (they might have implicit access as the owner of the space). Actually, wait - I passed `owner_open_id` which means the owner should be the user. But the API returned no members, which might mean the user is the owner implicitly.\n\nLet me try to add the user as a member explicitly.\n\nActually, I think the issue is that all documents are in the bot's folder. To create a document in the user's personal space (My Documents), I need to use the user's OAuth token, not the tenant token.\n\nLet me just focus on what I can do: the user has `full_access` on both documents. \n\nThe folder permissions are what's blocking the move operation, so I should add the user to the new document and suggest they access it from their Feishu app to see if the move option works from there.","thinkingSignature":"46e00469ae5e4a3e961079efaa10522de44c899105c01f1dd7ba33028dcff76d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ubhj8dloxky9_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/permissions/CUXnd71hloNZTzxMdtZjB2sFpxb/members?type=docx\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g2073td3EKILAO7NBFLGV5SNRALOBZCKUNI6VDP4\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"member_type\":\"openid\",\"member_id\":\"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\"perm\":\"full_access\"}' 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":105768,"output":360,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":117690,"cost":{"input":0.0317304,"output":0.000432,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03285612}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774792671847,"responseId":"061862e03575ff5c8132b15bb9fd26d5"}}
{"type":"message","id":"67b38180","parentId":"263d70aa","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:58:03.374Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ubhj8dloxky9_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"code\":0,\"data\":{\"member\":{\"member_id\":\"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\"member_type\":\"openid\",\"perm\":\"full_access\",\"perm_type\":\"container\"}},\"msg\":\"Success\"}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":818,"aggregated":"{\"code\":0,\"data\":{\"member\":{\"member_id\":\"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\"member_type\":\"openid\",\"perm\":\"full_access\",\"perm_type\":\"container\"}},\"msg\":\"Success\"}","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774792683365}}
{"type":"message","id":"abece6e7","parentId":"67b38180","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:58:17.239Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the user now has full_access on the new document. Now the problem is that both documents are in the same bot folder, and the user can't move either of them.\n\nThe fundamental issue: the bot creates documents in its own space. To create a document in the user's personal space (My Documents), I'd need to either:\n1. Use the user's OAuth token\n2. Or get the user's personal root folder token and create the document there\n\nActually, I wonder if I can get the user's personal folder token. Let me try to list the user's folders.\n\nActually, I just realized - maybe I should try to access the user's \"My Documents\" folder. But with the tenant token, I can only see files the bot has created or has access to. \n\nI'm hitting the same limitation - the bot creates documents in its own space, and I can't create folders through the API either. The core issue is that folder operations require different permissions or tokens than what I'm working with. I think the user might just need to move the document manually through the Feishu app itself.","thinkingSignature":"de2a4dc204a96ab5266630a6ddb8b49f85bbc9b2bef15533d82797d2371c0ed9"},{"type":"text","text":"\n[[reply_to_current]] 抱歉，API 创建的文档还是落在 bot 的文件夹里，动不了。\n\n唯一能走的路是**用你的个人 OAuth token** 来创建文档，那样才会直接落在你的个人文档库里。\n\n**如果你想长期解决**：告诉我怎么获取你的 user token（需要你做一次 OAuth 授权）。有了这个，我以后所有文档都直接创建在你个人空间，不用再折腾移动。\n\n**短期**：你现在手里有两个文档（原始版 + 我刚复制的新版），都有 full_access，你打开任何一个有内容就行。移动的事下次再说？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":106198,"output":337,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":118097,"cost":{"input":0.031859399999999996,"output":0.00040439999999999996,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03295752}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774792683376,"responseId":"061862eb08e7d0ca16419d200ae185c3"}}
