{"type":"message","id":"f4601e5e","parentId":"71fa3695","timestamp":"2026-03-29T14:17:41.662Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying they can't move the document because I haven't given them complete permissions. Let me think about this - I already added full_access permission. But maybe there's an issue with the folder itself - the document is in the bot's folder and the user might not have access to the parent folder even though they have access to the document.\n\nThe issue is that the document lives in a folder (parent_token: nodjpaHe7MntogaRuHkK6FaF8cd) that the user doesn't have access to. Having full_access on the document itself doesn't automatically give them access to the parent folder.\n\nThe error message the user saw was \"由于文件夹的权限设置，你没有当前文档的移动权限，请向 Lucus 申请移动\" - this means the user can see the document but can't move it because the parent folder permissions don't allow it.\n \nI'm realizing the core problem: full_access on a document doesn't include move permissions if the user lacks access to the parent folder. I could theoretically use the API to move it to root, but that would require drive permission which the user doesn't have. The real solution is either granting the user folder-level permissions or moving the document to a shared location they can access, though I'm not sure what folder_id would work for their personal space.\n\nLet me reconsider what I know about the folder structure - I can see the folder token exists, but I don't actually have a way to discover the user's root folder ID through the API. So instead of trying to fix permissions on a folder I can't access, I'll create a fresh document in their personal space by asking them to share the folder with write access, or just start over with a new document they create directly.","thinkingSignature":"dac075b70283c9eb714761333d15d2f9568fec12959dfa4127b17483679bcea2"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 你说得对，问题不在文档权限，在文件夹——文档在 bot 的文件夹里，你虽然有文档的 full_access，但那个文件夹本身你没有访问权限，所以移动操作被拒。\n\n**现在可以这样做**：你把你想要存放文档的那个文件夹分享给 bot（lucus 账号），我就有权限把文档移进去了。\n\n或者更简单——**你新建一个空白文档**，然后我把内容追加进去。新文档在你个人空间里，就没有这个问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":443,"cacheRead":117574,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":118017,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0.0005316,"cacheRead":0.0070544399999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00758604}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774793843704,"responseId":"06186774233177e0bb33ef5f08a9c579"}}
