{"type":"message","id":"b3fd42d7","parentId":"38a61cb8","timestamp":"2026-03-29T16:17:23.037Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GitHub is receiving the key and offering it, but it's not accepting it. This means the public key wasn't added to the GitHub account `blocklee` (which is the owner of the `my-openclaw` repo). The user said they added it, but it seems like either:\n1. The key was added to a different GitHub account (not `blocklee`)\n2. The key wasn't saved properly\n\nLet me tell the user about this - the SSH key we generated is being offered but GitHub rejects it. The user needs to make sure the key is added under the GitHub account `blocklee`.","thinkingSignature":"2289139197744fe520d9cf66e19d6a8e3025e243fbe96d43f4ddc257c96a3e53"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] SSH key 已经正确加载，但 GitHub 拒绝了。GitHub 说「收到了公钥但验证不通过」——说明这个 key 没有加在 `blocklee` 这个账号下。\n\n请再检查一下：\n1. 打开 https://github.com/settings/keys\n2. 确认这个 key 在 **blocklee** 这个账号的 SSH Keys 里，不是其他账号\n\n如果加错了账号，删掉重新加一次。确认加好之后告诉我。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":112735,"output":228,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":124525,"cost":{"input":0.033820499999999996,"output":0.0002736,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03478782}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774801035100,"responseId":"0618838bc530aed17f7a796047aec3d7"}}
