{"type":"message","id":"0742e162","parentId":"3be4153b","timestamp":"2026-03-29T18:40:56.558Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The JSON has an invalid escape sequence because I used `\\%` in the JSON string, but `\\` followed by `%` is not a valid escape in JSON. I need to fix this by either:\n1. Using `%%` instead of `\\%` (since `%%` in the shell becomes `%` through the cron job's shell processing)\n2. Or just using `%m` and `%d` without escaping the percent signs\n\nActually, looking at the original cron job for the daily-backup, it uses `$(date +\\%Y-\\%m-\\%d)` and that works. But wait, `\\%` is actually valid in JSON as an escaped backslash followed by a percent sign. \n\nSo `\\%` in JSON means a literal backslash followed by `%`. When this string is passed to a shell, `\\%` becomes just `%` since `\\%` isn't a special shell escape sequence. So the backslash gets treated as a literal character that gets consumed, leaving `%` for the date command to interpret.","thinkingSignature":"bb27c6379bd0df72f1c2015b1ef608756ad064456baa6d2628c6d3749d074a4c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_so68vg2ljdc4_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":105300,"output":248,"cacheRead":11562,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":117110,"cost":{"input":0.03159,"output":0.00029759999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00069372,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.032581320000000004}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774809648356,"responseId":"0618a530c0555558c8f3d90aebbcc47d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e1f92806","parentId":"0742e162","timestamp":"2026-03-29T18:40:56.570Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_so68vg2ljdc4_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503\",\n      \"name\": \"daily-backup\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774507489594,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774839480000,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 0 * * *\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 0\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"执行备份：cd ~/.openclaw && git add -A && git commit -m \\\"auto backup $(date +\\\\%Y-\\\\%m-\\\\%d)\\\" && git push && echo \\\"备份完成\\\"\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n        \"accountId\": \"lucus\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774867200000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 0,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 0,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastError\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"config-backup-8am\",\n      \"name\": \"config-backup-8am\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774843680000,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774843680000,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 8 * * *\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 0\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"备份 openclaw.json：cp ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-$(date +\\\\%Y\\%m\\%d) && echo \\\"openclaw.json 备份完成 $(date)\\\"\"\n      }