{"type":"message","id":"8b727a21","parentId":"dfcb818f","timestamp":"2026-03-29T18:46:25.648Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a3793a84acee762a2f70b21af\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 18:46 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53a3793a84acee762a2f70b21af]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 搜索env-guard 技能，并做审计报告"}],"timestamp":1774809985640}}
